{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112259896364429312", "3_2112259915347832832"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-19T19:09:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112259925984543076"], "id": "2112259925984543076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 114, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#121 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street. Good pandal and pratima. https://t.co/g3O6wWqjaR", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112259925984543076"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111902907394318336", "3_2111902907385937921", "3_2111902907893489664"]}, "author_id": "1441905846", "created_at": "2026-10-18T19:36:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111904308866449453"], "id": "2111904308866449453", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 430, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our visit to Samaj Sebi Sangha Puja pandal near Lake View Road was an amazing experience to wrap up our Saptami outing. Mahanayak Uttam Kumar Sir's theme adorned the pandal. My Wifey &amp; I exited after Darshan on observing overcrowding \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\n\n#Kolkata \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf3 #DurgaPuja \ud83d\uded5 https://t.co/AMunDSUgyE", "url": "https://x.com/IndianTrainFan/status/2111904308866449453"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111896119399866368", "3_2111896135879340032", "3_2111896153428279297"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T19:04:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111896164836774058"], "id": "2111896164836774058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 458, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#97 Visited Bosepukur Talbagan. Decent pandal and good pratima. https://t.co/fAuY2BHBXQ", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111896164836774058"}, {"author_id": "2609353712", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:59:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111894883359485991"], "id": "2111894883359485991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@jktaelove276069 Samee! I visited yesterday as well. The last pandal, before the severe downpour, which abruptly halted all of our further plans. Took provisional shelter at the Ahiritola Ghat untill the rain subsided. \ud83d\ude41", "url": "https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111894883359485991"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111876213879005184", "3_2111876230178119680", "3_2111876247534137344", "3_2111876261119467520"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T17:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111876272641179854"], "id": "2111876272641179854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 380, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#83 Visited Ballygunge Samaj sebi. They have also paid tribute to Mahanayak. Many pujos have done the same but Samaj sebi is the best of the lot by far. https://t.co/xfCjyWTXMn", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111876272641179854"}, {"author_id": "1942310957340057601", "created_at": "2026-10-18T02:59:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111653404691071073"], "id": "2111653404691071073", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@mrs__hazel On Saptami 2024, a heavy downpour happened for almost 40/45 mins, starting at around 7pm ... I , at that very moment, was at the Ahiritola Pujo which probably was one of the best that year... The police took barely 2 to 3 mins to clear our the entire queue ...", "url": "https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111653404691071073"}, {"author_id": "1942310957340057601", "created_at": "2026-10-18T02:43:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111649366587154726"], "id": "2111649366587154726", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AarKiBolboBolo2 It rained last year too... There was a downpour on Ashtami during 2024 too... In 2024 , I was at the Ahiritola pujo when the downpour started and it took the administration just a couple of minutes to clear our the entire queue", "url": "https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111649366587154726"}, {"author_id": "803197771389861888", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111518921622999095"], "id": "2111518921622999095", "note_tweet": {"text": "I\u2019m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab back home. When we passed near Chorbagan\u2019s main entrance, I saw police personnel and civic volunteers. The rain had kept the crowd relatively thin, and for a moment, I thought of going back.\n\nBut with the rain and the difficulty of finding a cab, I decided to return home.\n\nAnd then I saw the news.\n\nCompletely shattered. Heartbroken. Unable to process what happened.\n\nI keep thinking\u2026 if it hadn\u2019t rained, would I have still been there? Would I have been standing among those people?\n\nThere are so many thoughts running through my mind. So many unanswered questions. A strange, unsettling void that\u2019s difficult to explain.\n\nWe go out to celebrate Maa Durga, to seek blessings, to create memories with our loved ones. Nobody steps out expecting that a festive evening could turn into their last.\n\nPeople getting injured is heartbreaking enough. Losing lives while visiting a Durga Puja pandal is simply too devastating to comprehend.\n\nLife is frighteningly unpredictable. Sometimes, a little rain, a delayed cab, or a small decision to return home can change everything.\n\nTonight, my heart goes out to every family that has lost a loved one and to everyone affected by this tragedy.\n\nMay they find the strength to endure this unimaginable pain. \ud83d\ude4f\n\nSome festive evenings leave us with memories. Others leave us questioning how fragile life really is.\n\nOm Shanti. \ud83d\ude4f"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4719, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I\u2019m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab", "url": "https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"}, {"author_id": "70626051", "created_at": "2026-10-17T12:43:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111437874298232933"], "id": "2111437874298232933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Abhijit_Basak83 Good work, great lighting. But crowd management poor. Santosh Mitra Square, Ahiritola stands out.", "url": "https://x.com/wanderlust1587/status/2111437874298232933"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111427835042885632"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-17T12:03:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111427846212342175"], "id": "2111427846212342175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5151, "like_count": 682, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 25}, "text": "#29 Visited Ahiritola Sarbojonin\u2014 an absolute stunner by Subrata Mridha. https://t.co/xTarrNUaD8", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111427846212342175"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111355515628552192", "3_2111355534897262592", "3_2111355550504255488", "3_2111355563774984192"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111355574420230404"], "id": "2111355574420230404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 411, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#73 Visited Naktala Udayan Sangha. They are back from their downfall after arrest of \"\u0985\u09aa\u09be\". One of the best theme of Kolkata this year. Their theme is \"\u0995\u09be\u09b2 \u09a7\u09cd\u09ac\u09a8\u09bf\". They have illustrated the history, importance and impact of Panjikas. Beautifully executed. Absolutely recommend it. https://t.co/BIrqvmTgN1", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111355574420230404"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111140476783046656"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-16T17:01:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111140536509923579"], "id": "2111140536509923579", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 4331, "like_count": 263, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "If you are in area, do visit Samaj Sebi Sangha. Their theme is on 100 years of Mahanayak Uttam Kumar\u2014 but what is comforting here is the Opera style music playing in background. I visited again. Truly one of my favourites this year. https://t.co/efUKQ8ok2B", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111140536509923579"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111130487549050880", "3_2111130501486608384", "3_2111130514396770304", "3_2111130527109681152"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-16T16:21:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111130536941064655"], "id": "2111130536941064655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 8631, "like_count": 747, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 50}, "text": "#24 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street\u2014 A Sanatan Dinda masterclass. He loves to play with colours &amp; he absolutely nails it here. https://t.co/iw8Y3Or6Hr", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111130536941064655"}, {"author_id": "2074369902341918720", "created_at": "2026-10-16T12:54:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111078359392502113"], "id": "2111078359392502113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "North Kolkata\u2019s Durga Puja Themes 2026: Which Pandals Stand Out?\n\nKashi Bose Lane: \u2018\u0986\u09a6\u09bf\u09ae\u2019\nNabin Pally\nKumartuli\nAhiritola\nPandal-hopping plans\n\nDiscover what makes Durga Puja 2026 worth exploring. Watch the video for a closer look \ud83d\udc47\nhttps://t.co/6GobBLX8jy", "url": "https://x.com/Mchatterjee099/status/2111078359392502113"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110977127692877825"]}, "author_id": "819130177", "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:12:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110977142549029164"], "id": "2110977142549029164", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 426, "start": 412, "tag": "DurgaPuja2026"}, {"end": 441, "start": 427, "tag": "agnimitrapaul"}, {"end": 450, "start": 442, "tag": "EiSamay"}, {"end": 465, "start": 451, "tag": "eisamayonline"}]}, "text": "\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u0987 \u0986\u09a8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6, \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u0987 \u09ae\u09bf\u09b2\u09a8\u0964 \u09a4\u09be\u0987 \u0989\u09ce\u09b8\u09ac\u09c7\u09b0 \u0986\u09b2\u09cb \u099b\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09aa\u09a1\u09bc\u09c1\u0995 \u09b8\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0998\u09b0\u09c7\u2014\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ac\u09c0\u09a3 \u0993 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09b8\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09ae\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09be\u09b6\u09c7 \u09a6\u09be\u0981\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u0995\u09c7 \u09b8\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0995\u09b0\u09c7 \u09a4\u09cb\u09b2\u09be\u09b0 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09af\u09cb\u0997 \u09b0\u09be\u099c\u09cd\u09af\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a8\u0997\u09b0\u09cb\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8\u09af\u09bc\u09a8 \u0993 \u09aa\u09c1\u09b0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b7\u09af\u09bc\u0995 \u09a6\u09aa\u09cd\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0\u0964 \u09ac\u09c1\u09a7\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09bf\u09a3 \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09c1\u09b0\u09c1\u099a\u09bf \u09b8\u0999\u09cd\u0998\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ac\u09c0\u09a3 \u0993 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09b8\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09ae \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u2018\u09b0\u09c7\u09b8\u09cd\u099f\u09bf\u0982 \u09b2\u09be\u0989\u099e\u09cd\u099c\u2019-\u098f\u09b0 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8 \u0995\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8 \u09aa\u09c1\u09b0 \u0993 \u09a8\u0997\u09b0\u09cb\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8\u09af\u09bc\u09a8 \u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u0985\u0997\u09cd\u09a8\u09bf\u09ae\u09bf\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09be \u09aa\u09be\u09b2\u0964 \u098f\u0995\u0987 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09af\u09cb\u0997 \u099a\u09be\u09b2\u09c1 \u09b9\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u099b\u09c7 \u0989\u09a4\u09cd\u09a4\u09b0 \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u0986\u09b9\u09bf\u09b0\u09c0\u099f\u09cb\u09b2\u09be \u09af\u09c1\u09ac\u0995\u09ac\u09c3\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6 \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa\u09c7\u0993\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #agnimitrapaul #EiSamay #eisamayonline"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 164, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u0987 \u0986\u09a8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6, \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u0987 \u09ae\u09bf\u09b2\u09a8\u0964 \u09a4\u09be\u0987 \u0989\u09ce\u09b8\u09ac\u09c7\u09b0 \u0986\u09b2\u09cb \u099b\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09aa\u09a1\u09bc\u09c1\u0995 \u09b8\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0998\u09b0\u09c7\u2014\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ac\u09c0\u09a3 \u0993 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09b8\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09ae\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09be\u09b6\u09c7 \u09a6\u09be\u0981\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09c7 \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u0995\u09c7 \u09b8\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0995\u09b0\u09c7 \u09a4\u09cb\u09b2\u09be\u09b0 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09af\u09cb\u0997 \u09b0\u09be\u099c\u09cd\u09af\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a8\u0997\u09b0\u09cb\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8\u09af\u09bc\u09a8 \u0993 \u09aa\u09c1\u09b0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b7\u09af\u09bc\u0995 \u09a6\u09aa\u09cd\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0\u0964 \u09ac\u09c1\u09a7\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09bf\u09a3 \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09c1\u09b0\u09c1\u099a\u09bf \u09b8\u0999\u09cd\u0998\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ac\u09c0\u09a3 \u0993 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09b8\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09ae \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u2018\u09b0\u09c7\u09b8\u09cd\u099f\u09bf\u0982 https://t.co/MfwVI7Pcpr", "url": "https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2110977142549029164"}, {"author_id": "2984417534", "created_at": "2026-10-15T12:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110716323819082115"], "id": "2110716323819082115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3892, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "LIVE : \u099f\u09be\u09b2\u09be \u09ac\u09be\u09b0\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09b0\u09bf \u09b8\u09be\u09b0\u09cd\u09ac\u099c\u09a8\u09c0\u09a8 \u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0\u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u09b0 \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8 \u0985\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09cd\u09a0\u09be\u09a8\u09c7 \u0989\u09aa\u09b8\u09cd\u09a5\u09bf\u09a4 \u0986\u099b\u09c7\u09a8 \u0995\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0\u09af\u09bc \u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 @DrSukantaBJP  https://t.co/5Q4NykGfQ8", "url": "https://x.com/BJP4Bengal/status/2110716323819082115"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110659380723261440"]}, "author_id": "2082727700033372160", "created_at": "2026-10-15T09:11:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110659916646281329"], "id": "2110659916646281329", "note_tweet": {"text": "\u2728\ud83c\udf3a \u099a\u09a4\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u09a5\u09c0\u09b0 \u09b8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a7\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09af\u09bc \u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a3\u09ae\u09af\u09bc \u0986\u09af\u09bc\u09cb\u099c\u09a8\u09c7 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09cb\u09ce\u09b8\u09ac \u09e8\u09e6\u09e8\u09ec-\u098f\u09b0 \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8! \ud83c\udf3a\u2728\n\n \u098f\u0987 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u09b8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a7\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09af\u09bc \u0986\u09ae\u09be\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09be\u09b6\u09c7 \u099b\u09bf\u09b2\u09c7\u09a8 \u09ac\u09bf\u09a7\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u0995 \u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u0995\u09cc\u09b8\u09cd\u09a4\u09c1\u09ad \u09ac\u09be\u0997\u099a\u09c0, \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09bf\u09b7\u09cd\u099f \u09b0\u09be\u099c\u09a8\u09c0\u09a4\u09bf\u09ac\u09bf\u09a6 \u09a1\u0983 \u09a6\u09c0\u09aa\u09cd\u09b8\u09bf\u09a4\u09be \u09a7\u09b0, \u09ac\u09bf\u09a7\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u0995 \u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u0995\u09c1\u09a3\u09be\u09b2 \u0998\u09cb\u09b7,\u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09bf\u09b7\u09cd\u099f \u09b8\u09ae\u09be\u099c\u09b8\u09c7\u09ac\u09c0 \u09b0\u09be\u0995\u09c7\u09b6 \u09b8\u09bf\u0982, ICMR-NIRBI-\u098f\u09b0 \u09a1\u09bf\u09b0\u09c7\u0995\u09cd\u099f\u09b0 \u09a1\u09be\u0983 \u09b6\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09b8\u09ac\u09c1\u099c \u09a6\u09be\u09b8, \u09a1\u09be\u0983 \u09a6\u09c0\u09aa\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09ac\u09bf\u09a4\u09be \u09b9\u09be\u099c\u09be\u09b0\u09bf, \u099a\u09bf\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u099a\u09be\u09b2\u0995 \u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u0985\u09a8\u09bf\u09b0\u09cd\u09ac\u09be\u09a3 \u099a\u0995\u09cd\u09b0\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09c0, \u099f\u09be\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09c7\u099f\u09c7\u09a1 \u0987\u09a8\u09cd\u099f\u09be\u09b0\u09ad\u09c7\u09a8\u09b6\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u099c\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u099f \u09a1\u09bf\u09b0\u09c7\u0995\u09cd\u099f\u09b0 \u09a1\u09be\u0983 \u09b8\u09cb\u09ae\u09a8\u09be\u09a5 \u09a8\u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09b0, \u09b8\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u099f \u099c\u09c7\u09ad\u09bf\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09b0\u09cd\u09b8 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09cd\u09ac\u09ac\u09bf\u09a6\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09b2\u09af\u09bc, \u09b0\u09ac\u09c0\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09cd\u09b0\u09ad\u09be\u09b0\u09a4\u09c0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09cd\u09ac\u09ac\u09bf\u09a6\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09b2\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09bf\u09a8\u09bf\u09a7\u09bf\u09ac\u09c3\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6-\u09b8\u09b9 \u09b8\u09ae\u09be\u099c\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09ad\u09bf\u09a8\u09cd\u09a8 \u09b8\u09cd\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09bf\u09b7\u09cd\u099f \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u0995\u09cd\u09a4\u09bf\u09a4\u09cd\u09ac\u09b0\u09be\u0964\n\u0985\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09cd\u09a0\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u0985\u09a8\u09cd\u09af\u09a4\u09ae \u0986\u0995\u09b0\u09cd\u09b7\u09a3 \u099b\u09bf\u09b2 \u09b8\u09cd\u09ae\u09b0\u099c\u09bf\u09ce \u09b0\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u099a\u09cc\u09a7\u09c1\u09b0\u09c0 \u09b0\u099a\u09bf\u09a4 \u09af\u09cc\u09a8\u0995\u09b0\u09cd\u09ae\u09c0\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ac\u0987 \u2018\u09ae\u09b9\u09bf\u09b7\u09be\u09b8\u09c1\u09b0\u09ae\u09b0\u09cd\u09a6\u09bf\u09a8\u09c0 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u2019-\u09b0 \u0986\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09cd\u09a0\u09be\u09a8\u09bf\u0995 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8\u0964 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u09ac\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b6\u09bf\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09be\u0995\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b6\u09bf\u09b6\u09c1\u09a6\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a8\u09cb\u09ae\u09c1\u0997\u09cd\u09a7\u0995\u09b0 \u09a8\u09c3\u09a4\u09cd\u09af \u09