ps://x.com/just_avik/status/2110444664058982460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110248752569360384"]}, "author_id": "62762183", "created_at": "2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110248778200682765"], "id": "2110248778200682765", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 601, "start": 587, "tag": "DurgaPuja2026"}, {"end": 611, "start": 602, "tag": "Siliguri"}, {"end": 623, "start": 612, "tag": "WestBengal"}, {"end": 636, "start": 624, "tag": "DurgaPandal"}, {"end": 647, "start": 637, "tag": "DurgaPuja"}]}, "text": "More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the gold-adorned idols, drawing large numbers of devotees. Meanwhile, Kolkata\u2019s Ahiritola Sarbojanin Durga Pandal celebrates North Kolkata\u2019s rich cultural legacy through its history of milk distribution and traditional sweet-making, bringing together faith, folk culture and generations of culinary traditions.\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Siliguri #WestBengal #DurgaPandal #DurgaPuja"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2544, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA", "url": "https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110207034285232128"]}, "author_id": "1554085338364067842", "created_at": "2026-10-14T03:12:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110207050877993204"], "id": "2110207050877993204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "#\u0995\u09b0\u09cd\u09ae\u09b8\u09c2\u099a\u09bf: \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u09aa\u09c2\u099c\u09be\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8\n#\u0995\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09ac: \u0997\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09a7\u09c0 \u09aa\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09c0 \u09ac\u09bf\u09ac\u09c7\u0995\u09be\u09a8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6 \u09b8\u09cd\u09aa\u09cb\u09b0\u09cd\u099f\u09bf\u0982 \u0995\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09ac, \u09ac\u09a8\u0997\u09be\u0981\n\u09b9\u09bf\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09c1 \u09b9\u09c3\u09a6\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09b0\u09be\u099f \u09aa\u09b6\u09cd\u099a\u09bf\u09ae\u09ac\u0999\u09cd\u0997 \u09b8\u09b0\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ae\u09c1\u0996\u09cd\u09af\u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09a8\u09c0\u09af\u09bc \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09c1 \u0985\u09a7\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c0 \u09ae\u09b9\u09be\u09b6\u09af\u09bc \u0995\u09c7 \u09ac\u09a8\u0997\u09be\u0981 \u09eb \u09a8\u0982 \u0993\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09b0\u09cd\u09a1\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09be\u099c\u09b8\u09c7\u09ac\u09c0 \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09a8\u09c0\u09af\u09bc \u0985\u09b2\u09cb\u0995\u09c7\u09b6 \u0998\u09cb\u09b7\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u0982\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a7\u09a8\u09be \u099c\u09cd\u099e\u09be\u09aa\u09a8\u0964\n@bjpNabadwipZone @SuvenduWB https://t.co/udOeOMlv6V", "url": "https://x.com/BongaBJPBarta/status/2110207050877993204"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110081016732012544"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-13T18:51:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110081026114584782"], "id": "2110081026114584782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 4082, "like_count": 562, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 45}, "text": "#12 Visited Samaj Sebi Sangha. Theme on 100 years of Mahanayak Uttam Kumar. https://t.co/yA9eVfNd0w", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2110081026114584782"}, {"author_id": "3868003454", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912846398271869"], "id": "2109912846398271869", "note_tweet": {"text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. Divide the city geograpically. Fix your priorities. Maximize the usage of day hours when rush is relatively lesser. \n\nHere are few routes. \n\nFirst and foremost my top 2 routes for those visiting Kolkata just for experiencing Pujo. \n\n1. Old/North Kolkata Heritage Route: These are the OG pujos.\n\nBagbazar Sarbojanin \u2192 Ahiritola Sarbojanin \u2192 Kumartuli Park \u2192 Sovabazar Rajbari \u2192 Hatibagan Sarbojanin \u2192 Nalin Sarkar Street \u2192 Tala Prattoy.\n\n2. Kasba to Jodhpur Park - My go-to stretch. This is one of the longest stretch you can cover in one day covering 15+ famous ones if you are ready to do 50000 steps in a day. \n\nStart at Bosepukur Sitala Mandir \u2192 Bosepukur Talbagan \u2192 Ekdalia Evergreen \u2192 Singhi Park  \u2192 Deshapriya Park \u2192 Tridhara Sammilani \u2192 Hindustan Park \u2192 Maddox Square \u2192Mudiali \u2192 Jodhpur Park\n\nThen there are routes to cover depending upon where you staying:\n\nSalt Lake Cluster: These have relatively lesser rush and can be easily covered within a few hours (unless you get stuck in FD block one which is largest in scale)\nFD Block \u2192 AK Block \u2192 BJ Block \u2192 BD Block (plus you visit any additional blocks on the route)\n\nBehala Cluster: Would recommend to visit these during night. Behala Club \u2192 Behala Buroshibtala Janakalyan Sangha \u2192 Behala Natun Dal \u2192 Barisha Club \u2192 Barisha Sarbojanin\n\nVIP Road Cluster: Telengabagan \u2192 Sreebhumi Sporting Club \u2192 Lake Town Association \u2192 Dum Dum Park Tarun Sangha \u2192 Bharat Chakra \u2192 Dum Dum Park Youth Association \n\nAlipore Cluster: Alipore Sarbojanin \u2192 Chetla Agrani \u2192 Badamtala Ashar Sangha \u2192 66 Pally \u2192 Suruchi Sangha\n\nGaria Cluster: Naktala Udayan Sangha \u2192 Naktala Pally Unnayan Samity \u2192 Garia Naba Durga \u2192 Pancha Durga \u2192 Patuli Sarbojanin \n\nIf you are not from Kolkata, I would suggest avoid the big Pujas of Central Kolkata (Md. Ali Park \u2192 Santosh Mitra Square \u2192 College Square). They get insane crowd from people flocking Kolkata from nearby districts for a day due to nearness to Sealdah and Howrah stations. They are very popular but you need adventurous spirit to tackle them."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 4714, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ", "url": "https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 3264, "media_key": "3_2112259896364429312", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBLzwa8AADwpD.jpg", "width": 2448}, {"height": 3264, "media_key": "3_2112259915347832832", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBM6easAAggxh.jpg", "width": 2448}, {"height": 1920, "media_key": "13_2111902907394318336", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2111902907394318336/img/zORxuiHqg-cM8VK_.jpg", "type": "video", "width": 1080}, {"height": 4080, "media_key": "3_2111902907385937921", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU78gULagAELGmE.jpg", "width": 3060}, {"height": 4080, "media_key": "3_2111902907893489664", "t